'''Confident Raider''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Hard|hard combat achievement]] which requires the player to complete a [[Tombs of Amascut]] raid at level 100 or above. Although this achievement is classified as an Entry Mode task, it can be completed in a Normal or Expert mode raid.

